      "show": "Today we are going to learn about notes together."
    },
    {
      "id": "rem",
      "who": "melody",
      "text": "Remember? <break time=\"0.5s\" /> Every note is a sound… <break time=\"0.4s\" /> we can play one note… <break time=\"0.4s\" /> and then another.",
      "speed": 0.88,
      "show": "Remember? Every note is a sound… we can play one note… and then another."
    },
    {
      "id": "three",
      "who": "barnaby",
      "text": "Let's play three notes… <break time=\"0.4s\" /> one… <break time=\"0.4s\" /> after another.",
      "speed": 0.88,
      "show": "Let's play three notes… one… after another."
    },
    {
      "id": "mel",
      "who": "melody",
      "text": "Notes one after another make a tune. <break time=\"0.5s\" /> A tune is also called… <break time=\"0.4s\" /> a melody. <break time=\"0.4s\" /> Just like me!",
      "speed": 0.88,
      "show": "Notes one after another make a tune. A tune is also called… a melody. Just like me!"
    },
    {
      "id": "tog1",
      "who": "barnaby",
      "text": "Now let's play the same notes… <break time=\"0.4s\" /> all at the same time.",
